WEBVTT

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.900
The sun shines around me

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.680
Shines in the endless clouds

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:29.590
You can hear the blue sky

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:50.190
It's close by, a great dragon

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.010
Chao!

00:01:01.084 --> 00:01:01.364
Hey!

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:29.460
Five years have passed in an opening and closing of eyes, since Piccolo wanted to take over the world, but thanks to Goku everything returned to normal.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:43.880
Peace reigned in the world every day, but a new threat was approaching.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:14.180
We present, appears a mini Goku, his name is Gohan

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.220
This is perfect!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:29.260
I also die of hunger.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:32.490
What are you saying? I asked you if you haven't seen Gohan.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:33.730
What? I haven't seen him.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.850
Where did that kid go?

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.670
If they don't eat fast, they won't be able to leave,

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.530
and Master Roshi will be waiting for them to accompany him.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:42.990
Okay, I'll go look for him.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.840
I'm pretty sure he's not far from here.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.520
Yeah, don't worry!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.120
I love him!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.590
That kid is just like his father.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.480
I'm just a little short.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:30.540
Oh!

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:33.690
Ah!

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:35.680
Ah!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:37.840
Ah!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:41.700
Ah!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.820
What the hell was that?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.960
Was it a meteorite or an UFO?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:48.780
Ah!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:52.470
I'll go and ask for help.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.300
Isn't this a meteorite?

00:06:28.636 --> 00:06:29.636
What the...

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:32.420
Huh?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:34.250
Huh?

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:39.700
Huh?

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:55.540
Huh?

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:55.990
Huh?

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.300
It's true. This planet is still alive.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.550
That son of a bitch!

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.260
Tell me, quickly! Who are you?

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:29.500
You only have five powers to fight. You're a piece of trash.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:33.390
Don't even think about getting closer, I'll make you fly in pieces!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:58.940
What a race with so few powers. There is someone who is more powerful.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.400
It's 4880.

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:04.760
It must be Kakaroto!

00:08:34.252 --> 00:08:36.252
Thanks for watching!

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:12.740
No, real butterfly!

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.310
There it is!

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:31.150
Yes?

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:46.220
Ahem.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:31.190
Thank you.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:01.730
Uh-huh.

00:12:35.404 --> 00:12:37.864
We return with Dragon Ball Z

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:02.640
Ah!

00:13:10.876 --> 00:13:11.556
Hey!

00:13:11.708 --> 00:13:12.708
Gohan!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:13:59.770
What's up?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.000
Thank you for watching!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:03.920
GARITO

00:14:04.572 --> 00:14:05.932
My name is Gohan.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.350
Hey, you! And that hat?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.760
That hat is my son's! It's Gohan's!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:46.280
Where did you find it?

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:51.040
Where did you find it?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:31.540
I don't know.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:16.190
RESIST AND SAVE YOURSELF OR MORE!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.040
Thank you very much.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.620
Gohan, what did you do?

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:13.160
Gohan, let's go back. Your mom is very worried about you.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:17.730
And also remember that we have to go to Master Roshi's house as fast as possible.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:43.660
Oh my god, that cockatiel!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:59.820
What is this power?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.000
Yes, yes, yes.

00:19:01.184 --> 00:19:02.184
IMPOSSIBLE!

00:19:02.588 --> 00:19:03.488
Is it Goku?

00:19:18.172 --> 00:19:18.772
That's him!

00:19:27.964 --> 00:19:29.964
I know you're not Kakaroto.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.430
Who the hell are you? What do you want from me?

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.510
I absolutely don't want anything from you.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:39.550
Then why did you come? Do you want to die?

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:42.920
You feel very powerful.

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:50.540
Verde pelea is 322.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.910
How many subjects are there like that?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:56.380
But you are not the right opponent for me.

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:57.780
What did you say?

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.840
First of all, do you really know?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.040
Do you know who you are messing with?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.680
Who knows?

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:26.670
What a boring technique

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:29.830
You're just getting up

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:40.990
This time it will be my turn, now I will teach you what a real technique is.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.500
I think there is someone more powerful in this place.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:59.970
Over there, he is 12 years old.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:05.750
In 1909. It's a lot of energy. I think it's the most powerful on this planet.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:09.170
That has to be Kakaroto!

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:25.080
It's impossible! I couldn't move a millimeter!

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:51.460
I have lost the pride of being one of the strongest Saiyajin fighters in the universe.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.070
Kakaroto!

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:11.410
Who are the strongest fighters in the universe?

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:13.790
That is, the Saiyajin warriors.

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:16.260
And what does Kakaroto mean?

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:20.560
It seems that Goku and this mysterious fighter have some relationship.

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:25.800
But, will the truth of Goku's past be finally known?

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.290
In the next chapter!

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.200
Thank you.

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.240
The cloud you fly is very practical

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:37.380
Many horizons help you to see

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:39.940
When suddenly is the time to say goodbye

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:41.360
Terrible

00:23:43.970 --> 00:23:46.270
Mami-sama can be very cruel

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:47.070
Sorry

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:00.590
then
